          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "指出该反应中的亲核试剂。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000399-02",
      "label": "9-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "简述催化剂六氢吡啶在反应中的具体作用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000399-03",
      "label": "9-3",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "化合物A是合成抗痉挛药物D(gabapentin)的前体。根据上述反应式,写出合成A的2个起始原料的结构简式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$\\begin{array}{c} \\text{COOCH}_{2}\\text{CH}_{3} \\\\ \\text{COOCH}_{2}\\text{CH}_{3} \\end{array}$$"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000399-04",
      "label": "9-4",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "画出由A制备D过程中中间体B、C和产物D的结构简式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$\\mathrm{A} \\xrightarrow[\\mathrm{H}_{2}\\mathrm{O}]{\\mathrm{NaCN}} \\mathrm{B} \\xrightarrow[\\Delta]{\\mathrm{H}_{2},\\text{cat.}} \\mathrm{C} \\xrightarrow[\\Delta]{\\mathrm{NaOH},\\mathrm{H}_{2}\\mathrm{O}} \\mathrm{D}$$"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
